# The pipeline-set fast path, verify mode (DM_PIPESET=2; dm/gfx/nvn/hle_nvn.c, rewriter PIPESET): the game's pipeline-set function returns at once on a true
# repeat. In verify mode every set the fast path would skip goes to the host first, which compares the pipeline's states with what this recording last bound,
# and then runs the original function. Camp, then the walk into the Blood Moor: some sets must have been checked and none may differ (a difference is a red line)
name pipeset_verify
requires cli
save warlock
env DM_GAME_SEED=305419896 DM_PIPESET=2
timeout 240

enter_game
sleep 4
walk_to 5789 4470 timeout=20
walk_to 5789 4495 timeout=20
walk_to 5791 4523 timeout=25
expect_state area=2 timeout=10
walk_to 5791 4560 timeout=25
sleep 11
quit
check log_has re="pipeset verify: [1-9][0-9]* checked, 0 differ" last="pipeset verify:"
check no_red
